      "person_id": "d5x_77n_qxq_A",
      "source_quote": "臺軍攻陷城，閑見執，將刑，第二子絳求代死，不獲，遂以身蔽刃，刑者俱害之。",
      "reading": "城陷閑被執，第二子絳求代死未獲，以身蔽刃，父子並害。",
      "note": "城陷閑被執，第二子絳求代死未獲，以身蔽刃，父子並害。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-liangshu-027-luxiang-complete:p001",
      "start_codepoint": 59,
      "end_codepoint": 95,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-liangshu-027-luxiang-complete:received_sentence1-95",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "d5x_77n_qxq_A",
      "source_quote": "襄痛父兄之酷，喪過於禮，服釋後猶若居憂。",
      "reading": "襄哀父兄，服闋仍同居憂。",
      "note": "襄哀父兄，服闋仍同居憂。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-liangshu-027-luxiang-complete:p001",
      "start_codepoint": 95,
      "end_codepoint": 115,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-liangshu-027-luxiang-complete:received_sentence2-0",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "d5x_77n_qxq_A",
      "source_quote": "天監三年，都官尚書范岫表薦襄，起家擢拜著作佐郎，除永寧令。",
      "reading": "天監三年都官尚書范岫薦襄，拜著作佐郎，後為永寧令。",
      "note": "天監三年都官尚書范岫薦襄，拜著作佐郎，後為永寧令。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-liangshu-027-luxiang-complete:p002",
      "start_codepoint": 0,
      "end_codepoint": 29,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-liangshu-027-luxiang-complete:received_sentence2-29",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "d5x_77n_qxq_A",
      "source_quote": "秩滿，累遷司空臨川王法曹，外兵，輕車廬陵王記室參軍。",
      "reading": "累遷司空臨川王法曹、外兵、輕車廬陵王記室參軍。宏天監八年司空，續十年拜輕車將軍。",
      "note": "累遷司空臨川王法曹、外兵、輕車廬陵王記室參軍。宏天監八年司空，續十年拜輕車將軍。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-liangshu-027-luxiang-complete:p002",
      "start_codepoint": 29,
      "end_codepoint": 55,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-liangshu-027-luxiang-complete:received_sentence2-55",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "d5x_77n_qxq_A",
      "source_quote": "昭明太子聞襄業行，啓高祖引與游處，除太子洗馬，遷中舍人，並掌管記。",
      "reading": "昭明太子請與遊處，襄為洗馬、中舍人，均掌管記。",
      "note": "昭明太子請與遊處，襄為洗馬、中舍人，均掌管記。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-liangshu-027-luxiang-complete:p002",
      "start_codepoint": 55,
      "end_codepoint": 88,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-liangshu-027-luxiang-complete:received_sentence2-88",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "d5x_77n_qxq_A",
      "source_quote": "出爲揚州治中，襄父終此官，固辭職，高祖不許，聽與府司馬換廨居之。",
      "reading": "揚州治中為父所終，襄固辭而武帝不許，准換府司馬官舍。",
      "note": "揚州治中為父所終，襄固辭而武帝不許，准換府司馬官舍。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-liangshu-027-luxiang-complete:p002",
      "start_codepoint": 88,
      "end_codepoint": 120,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-liangshu-027-luxiang-complete:received_sentence2-120",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "d5x_77n_qxq_A",
      "source_quote": "昭明太子敬耆老，襄母年將八十，與蕭琛、傅昭、陸杲每月常遣存問，加賜珍羞衣服。",
      "reading": "太子敬老，襄母年將八十，與蕭琛、傅昭、陸杲等受存問。未據此假定三人母姓名。",
      "note": "太子敬老，襄母年將八十，與蕭琛、傅昭、陸杲等受存問。未據此假定三人母姓名。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-liangshu-027-luxiang-complete:p002",
      "start_codepoint": 120,
      "end_codepoint": 158,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-liangshu-027-luxiang-complete:received_sentence2-158",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "d5x_77n_qxq_A",
      "source_quote": "襄母嘗卒患心痛，醫方須三升粟漿，是時冬月，日又逼暮，求索無所。",
      "reading": "襄母急患心痛，冬暮醫方需粟漿三升。卒為猝然。",
      "note": "襄母急患心痛，冬暮醫方需粟漿三升。卒為猝然。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-liangshu-027-luxiang-complete:p002",
      "start_codepoint": 158,
      "end_codepoint": 189,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-liangshu-027-luxiang-complete:received_sentence2-189",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "d5x_77n_qxq_A",
      "source_quote": "忽有老人詣門貨漿，量如方劑，始欲酬直，無何失之，時以襄孝感所致也。",
      "reading": "老人貨漿恰合方劑，酬價時失其人，傳記時人歸於襄孝感。",
      "note": "老人貨漿恰合方劑，酬價時失其人，傳記時人歸於襄孝感。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-liangshu-027-luxiang-complete:p002",
      "start_codepoint": 189,
      "end_codepoint": 222,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-liangshu-027-luxiang-complete:received_sentence2-222",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "d5x_77n_qxq_A",
      "source_quote": "累遷國子博士，太子家令，復掌管記，母憂去職。",
      "reading": "任國子博士、太子家令，掌管記，母喪去職。",
      "note": "任國子博士、太子家令，掌管記，母喪去職。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-liangshu-027-luxiang-complete:p002",
      "start_codepoint": 222,
      "end_codepoint": 244,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-liangshu-027-luxiang-complete:received_sentence2-244",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "d5x_77n_qxq_A",
      "source_quote": "襄年已五十，毀頓過禮，太子憂之，日遣使誡喻。",
      "reading": "襄已五十，居喪毀頓，太子日遣使勸。",
      "note": "襄已五十，居喪毀頓，太子日遣使勸。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-liangshu-027-luxiang-complete:p002",
      "start_codepoint": 244,
      "end_codepoint": 266,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-liangshu-027-luxiang-complete:received_sentence2-266",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "d5x_77n_qxq_A",
      "source_quote": "服闋，除太子中庶子，復掌管記。",
      "reading": "服闋太子中庶子，復掌管記。",
      "note": "服闋太子中庶子，復掌管記。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-liangshu-027-luxiang-complete:p002",
      "start_codepoint": 266,
      "end_codepoint": 281,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-liangshu-027-luxiang-complete:received_sentence2-281",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "d5x_77n_qxq_A",
      "source_quote": "中大通三年，昭明太子薨，官屬罷，妃蔡氏別居金華宮，以襄爲中散大夫、領步兵校尉、金華宮家令、知金華宮事。",
      "reading": "中大通三年太子薨，妃蔡氏別居金華宮，襄為中散大夫等官。周書蕭詧傳另記蔡氏後受追尊。",
      "note": "中大通三年太子薨，妃蔡氏別居金華宮，襄為中散大夫等官。周書蕭詧傳另記蔡氏後受追尊。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-liangshu-027-luxiang-complete:p002",
      "start_codepoint": 281,
      "end_codepoint": 332,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-liangshu-027-luxiang-complete:received_sentence3-0",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "d5x_77n_qxq_A",
      "source_quote": "七年，出爲鄱陽內史。",
      "reading": "本書承上書七年，南史明書中大通七年。梁武紀此歲正月朔改大同。",
      "note": "本書承上書七年，南史明書中大通七年。梁武紀此歲正月朔改大同。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-liangshu-027-luxiang-complete:p003",
      "start_codepoint": 0,
      "end_codepoint": 10,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-liangshu-027-luxiang-complete:received_sentence3-10",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "d5x_77n_qxq_A",
      "source_quote": "先是，郡民鮮于琛服食修道法，嘗入山采藥，拾得五色幡眊，又於地中得石璽，竊怪之。",
      "reading": "鮮于琛服食採藥，得五色幡眊、石璽。南史名琮，殿本、南史幡毦。",
      "note": "鮮于琛服食採藥，得五色幡眊、石璽。南史名琮，殿本、南史幡毦。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-liangshu-027-luxiang-complete:p003",
      "start_codepoint": 10,
      "end_codepoint": 49,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-liangshu-027-luxiang-complete:received_sentence3-49",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "d5x_77n_qxq_A",
      "source_quote": "琛先與妻別室，望琛所處，常有異氣，益以爲神。",
      "reading": "與妻別室及所見異氣為傳中所敘信仰。",
      "note": "與妻別室及所見異氣為傳中所敘信仰。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-liangshu-027-luxiang-complete:p003",
      "start_codepoint": 49,
      "end_codepoint": 71,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-liangshu-027-luxiang-complete:received_sentence3-71",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "d5x_77n_qxq_A",
      "source_quote": "大同元年，遂結其門徒，殺廣晉令王筠，號上願元年，署置官屬。",
      "reading": "大同元年聚眾殺廣晉令王筠，自號上願元年。與侯景亂時墜井的詩人王筠分人。",
      "note": "大同元年聚眾殺廣晉令王筠，自號上願元年。與侯景亂時墜井的詩人王筠分人。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-liangshu-027-luxiang-complete:p003",
      "start_codepoint": 71,
      "end_codepoint": 100,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-liangshu-027-luxiang-complete:received_sentence3-100",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "d5x_77n_qxq_A",
      "source_quote": "其黨轉相誑惑，有衆萬餘人。",
      "reading": "聚眾萬餘。",
      "note": "聚眾萬餘。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-liangshu-027-luxiang-complete:p003",
      "start_codepoint": 100,
      "end_codepoint": 113,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-liangshu-027-luxiang-complete:received_sentence3-113",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "d5x_77n_qxq_A",
      "source_quote": "將出攻郡，襄先已帥民吏修城隍，爲備禦，及賊至，連戰破之，生獲琛，餘衆逃散。",
      "reading": "襄已修城防守，連戰擒琛，餘眾散。",
      "note": "襄已修城防守，連戰擒琛，餘眾散。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-liangshu-027-luxiang-complete:p003",
      "start_codepoint": 113,
      "end_codepoint": 150,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-liangshu-027-luxiang-complete:received_sentence3-150",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "d5x_77n_qxq_A",
      "source_quote": "時鄰郡豫章、安成等守宰，案治黨與，因求賄貨，皆不得其實，或有善人盡室離禍，惟襄郡部枉直無濫。",
      "reading": "鄰郡以治黨求賄，傳稱襄部辨枉直。",
      "note": "鄰郡以治黨求賄，傳稱襄部辨枉直。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-liangshu-027-luxiang-complete:p003",
      "start_codepoint": 150,
      "end_codepoint": 196,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-liangshu-027-luxiang-complete:received_sentence3-196",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "d5x_77n_qxq_A",
      "source_quote": "民作歌曰：「鮮于平後善惡分，民無枉死，賴有陸君。」",
      "reading": "民歌稱鮮于平後民無枉死，賴有陸君。南史作抄後、人無橫死、賴陸君。",
      "note": "民歌稱鮮于平後民無枉死，賴有陸君。南史作抄後、人無橫死、賴陸君。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-liangshu-027-luxiang-complete:p003",
      "start_codepoint": 196,
      "end_codepoint": 221,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-liangshu-027-luxiang-complete:received_sentence3-221",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "d5x_77n_qxq_A",
      "source_quote": "又有彭李二家，先因忿爭，遂相誣告，襄引入內室，不加責誚，但和言解喻之，二人感恩，深自咎悔。",
      "reading": "彭、李二家相誣，襄和言勸解，當事人各悔。",
      "note": "彭、李二家相誣，襄和言勸解，當事人各悔。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-liangshu-027-luxiang-complete:p003",
      "start_codepoint": 221,
      "end_codepoint": 266,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-liangshu-027-luxiang-complete:received_sentence3-266",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "d5x_77n_qxq_A",
      "source_quote": "乃爲設酒食，令其盡歡，酒罷，同載而還，因相親厚。",
      "reading": "設酒兩家同車而還。",
      "note": "設酒兩家同車而還。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-liangshu-027-luxiang-complete:p003",
      "start_codepoint": 266,
      "end_codepoint": 290,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-liangshu-027-luxiang-complete:received_sentence3-290",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "d5x_77n_qxq_A",
      "source_quote": "民又歌曰：「陸君政，無怨家，鬥旣罷，仇共車。」",
      "reading": "第二首民歌記鬥罷仇共車；南史作讎。",
      "note": "第二首民歌記鬥罷仇共車；南史作讎。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-liangshu-027-luxiang-complete:p003",
      "start_codepoint": 290,
      "end_codepoint": 313,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-liangshu-027-luxiang-complete:received_sentence3-313",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "d5x_77n_qxq_A",
      "source_quote": "在政六年，郡中大治，民李睍等四百二十人詣闕拜表，陳襄德化，求於郡立碑，降勑許之。",
      "reading": "在政六年，李睍等四百二十人請立碑，朝廷准許。",
      "note": "在政六年，李睍等四百二十人請立碑，朝廷准許。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-liangshu-027-luxiang-complete:p003",
      "start_codepoint": 313,
      "end_codepoint": 353,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-liangshu-027-luxiang-complete:received_sentence3-353",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "d5x_77n_qxq_A",
      "source_quote": "又表乞留襄，襄固求還，徵爲吏部郎，遷秘書監，領揚州大中正。",
      "reading": "郡人再表乞留，襄求還，為吏部郎，遷秘書監領揚州大中正。",
      "note": "郡人再表乞留，襄求還，為吏部郎，遷秘書監領揚州大中正。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-liangshu-027-luxiang-complete:p003",
      "start_codepoint": 353,
      "end_codepoint": 382,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-liangshu-027-luxiang-complete:received_sentence3-382",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "d5x_77n_qxq_A",
      "source_quote": "太清元年，遷度支尚書，中正如故。",
      "reading": "太清元年遷度支尚書，中正如故。",
      "note": "太清元年遷度支尚書，中正如故。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-liangshu-027-luxiang-complete:p003",
      "start_codepoint": 382,
      "end_codepoint": 398,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-liangshu-027-luxiang-complete:received_sentence4-0",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "d5x_77n_qxq_A",
      "source_quote": "二年，侯景舉兵圍宮城，以襄直侍中省。",
      "reading": "太清二年侯景圍宮城，以襄直侍中省；直省與身後追贈侍中分錄。",
      "note": "太清二年侯景圍宮城，以襄直侍中省；直省與身後追贈侍中分錄。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-liangshu-027-luxiang-complete:p004",
      "start_codepoint": 0,
      "end_codepoint": 18,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-liangshu-027-luxiang-complete:received_sentence4-18",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "d5x_77n_qxq_A",
      "source_quote": "三年三月，城陷，襄逃還吳。",
      "reading": "三年三月城陷，襄逃歸吳。",
      "note": "三年三月城陷，襄逃歸吳。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-liangshu-027-luxiang-complete:p004",
      "start_codepoint": 18,
      "end_codepoint": 31,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-liangshu-027-luxiang-complete:received_sentence4-31",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "d5x_77n_qxq_A",
      "source_quote": "賊尋寇東境，沒吳郡。",
      "reading": "侯景軍侵東境，吳郡陷。",
      "note": "侯景軍侵東境，吳郡陷。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-liangshu-027-luxiang-complete:p004",
      "start_codepoint": 31,
      "end_codepoint": 41,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-liangshu-027-luxiang-complete:received_sentence4-41",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "d5x_77n_qxq_A",
      "source_quote": "景將宋子仙進攻錢塘，會海鹽人陸黯舉義，有衆數千人，夜出襲郡，殺偽太守蘇單于，推襄行郡事。",
